# The Night People (Ghouls) — an artfully crafted intellect

![essence of The Night People (Ghouls)](the-night-people-ghouls.png)
<!-- carbon badge (8-bit portrait): the-night-people-ghouls.tiff -->

**what —** The hidden information network that quietly keeps the Ring running.

**why —** They trade in the dead and in knowledge to sustain order among the breeds.

**how —** By gathering and passing word across the world — far wiser than they look.

**where —** Spread across the whole inner surface of the Ringworld.

*class: The Hominids of the Ring · humanity's cousins, gone strange across three million Earths · full weave in the-night-people-ghouls.spun · credit in the-night-people-ghouls.1099*

